<title>USA: AMB Financial Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>AMB Financial Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>MUNSTER, Ind. 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 0.01   profit	   n/a</p>
<p> Net loss			12   profit	    87</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.26   profit	   n/a</p>
<p> Net profit		   269   profit	   282</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results were reduced by a one-time charge of $389,000 for recaitalization of the Savings Association Insurance Fund. Excluding the charge, earnings would have been $222,000, or $0.21 a share, in the third quarter and $502,000, or $0.48, for the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>AMB Financial completed an initial public offering of 1.1 million shares on March 29.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
